<title>INDIA: India Corporation Bank to lower prime lending rate.</title>
<headline>India Corporation Bank to lower prime lending rate.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-run Corporation Bank said on Tuesday it planned to reduce its prime lending rate (PLR) to 14 percent from the current 14.5 percent.  </p>
<p>&quot;We have decided to reduce the PLR to 14 percent,&quot; a senior official told Reuters.</p>
<p>He said the proposal would be discussed by the board of directors on April 19.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
